REST Endpoints
GET /health
Returns system health status.

POST /api/analyze/image
Analyzes a single uploaded frame for drowsiness metrics.

Headers: X-Session-ID: <UUID> (Optional, defaults to stateless)

Body: multipart/form-data with file: <Image>

Response:
{
  "session_id": "e4b2d189-3221-4f9e-a89c-8a623f2f0122",
  "ear": 0.18,
  "mar": 0.42,
  "drowsy": true,
  "yawning": false,
  "sleeping": false,
  "timestamp": "2026-10-12T13:30:00"
}

GET /api/status
Fetches analytics summary for a specific driver session.

Headers: X-Session-ID: <UUID>

POST /api/reset
Resets the state timers and frame logs for a given session.

Headers: X-Session-ID: <UUID>
